  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Nationwide Internet Exchange Point and Fiber Expansion, through Enterprise - United States Unknown</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant funds a feasibility study (Study) to assess the technical and economic viability of Responsible Internet Sustainability Effort, Inc.&apos;s proposed rollout of internet exchange points and a carrier-neutral wholesale fiber network across the Philippines (Project). U.S. firm Connectivity Capital LLC will carry out the Study on a sole-source basis.</narrative>
